;
Present system is contains only the N-terminal domain of the Tissue Inhibitor
of Metalloproteinase where as the related system in the X-ray structure (PDB
entry 1UEA) has a full length. In addtion, the present system has been studied
in solution as a complex with a mutant matrix metalloproteinase-3(E202Q).
;
